          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On October 22, 1984, at approximately 6:50 PM, two motorists observed near a railroad track a bright light. It had the shape of a white ball with a distinct white beam emanating from it. As the windows of the cars were closed, no sound was heard. The investigation will show that it was the 600-watt searchlight of a Puma helicopter in the approach phase for landing at the nearby military base.",
